OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe east
OL,6,Fwill have a dry evening and night, but
OL,7,Fpassing light showers will affect the
OL,8,Fwest. Fresh westerly winds across the
OL,9,Fnorth at first this evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FSome bright or sunny
OL,12,Fintervals. Scattered showers across
OL,13,Fthe west but drier with fewer showers
OL,14,Fin the east. Colder than of late.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,17,Fintervals and scattered showers on
OL,18,FWednesday. Dry and bright on Thursday
OL,19,Fbefore rain east later. Early rain on
OL,20,FFriday followed by showers, mainly in
OL,21,Fwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
